body:
 #### Problem
The call to `ReferenceCounted::Retain()' and `Release()` function crashes. The test that reproduces the crash is

```
    ReferenceCounted<int> testObj;
    NL_TEST_ASSERT(inSuite, testObj.GetReferenceCount() == 1);
    testObj.Retain();
    NL_TEST_ASSERT(inSuite, testObj.GetReferenceCount() == 2);
    testObj.Release();
    NL_TEST_ASSERT(inSuite, testObj.GetReferenceCount() == 1);
```

```
../../../../../../build/autoconf/test-driver: line 107: 66702 Aborted                 "$@" > $log_file 2>&1
FAIL: TestReferenceCounted
```

 #### Proposed Solution
Find the issue and fix it.

