[2021-09-14T17:37:30Z] user_00018: Alternatively, why not just invoke a Post method to asynchronously handle clean-up of the accessing session? That way, in the code flow that is handling the message on the exchange, it can safely send a response back on that session (immediately though), and then in a async code path due to the post, actually clean-up the session.

