    if (![controller commissionDevice:deviceId commissioningParams:params error:&error]) {
        NSLog(@"Failed to commission Device %llu, with error %@", deviceId, error);
    }
}
```
Thanks for any help.

(on a side note to enter the QR code scanning screen due to it crashing, see issue: https://github.com/project-chip/connectedhomeip/issues/15638 we had to modify KeyValueStoreManagerImpl.mm see link for details.)

