Receipt of NotifyUpdateApplied indicates that the other side has applied an OTA update, and presumably rebooted.

This seems like a signal that we should evict all other sessions (as in, except the one we get the command on) to the relevant node, since the chance that it preserved sessions across OTA is pretty slim.

@user_00018 @user_00375 thoughts?

