</details>

As a result, I receive a request to read attributes in emberAfExternalAttributeReadCallback and see attributes written to emberAfExternalAttributeWriteCallback

It's all good - I can work with that.

Other types of devices - sensors, for example, which I create also work well.

Next, I'm trying to create a thermostat.

<details>
