Unknown what triggers this. I hit it a couple times a week. 
~~~
2023-05-17 18:36:28.971  9950-10039 AndroidRuntime          com.lowpan.m2                        E  FATAL EXCEPTION: NsdManager
                                                                                                    Process: com.lowpan.m2, PID: 9950
