Those releases are done, so no.

But past that: OK.  So you're using the deprecated API because that's all you can do on 16.3, that makes sense.  

I assume the actual call to the `MTRNOCChainGenerationCompleteHandler` is happening asynchronously, and not under the call to `onNOCChainGenerationNeeded:attestationInfo:onNOCChainGenerationComplete:`?

I also assume this is a crash (application closes), not a hang (application freezes up)?

If either of those assumptions is wrong, please let me know.



