[2023-09-15T16:11:53Z] user_00012: Sorry, I meant to say "attach, don't paste" for logs as above....

>  stuck in onNOCChainGenerationComplete at ios16.3

So a hang?  That would make sense if so.

> I do like this, under the call to onNOCChainGenerationNeeded:attestationInfo:onNOCChainGenerationComplete:

Yeah, on 1.3 that will deadlock because it's got a silly dispatch_sync to call `onNOCChainGenerationNeeded:...`.  Just do the call to onNOCChainGenerationComplete async, and that should fix the hang.

