[2025-10-01T01:28:22Z] user_00012: Credentials can be removed by a different fabric, but not modified by a different fabric.  This is pretty clearly spelled out in the spec for the Door Lock cluster.  Specifically, "5.2.10.36. SetCredential Command" says, for the "Modify" case of OperationType:

> INVALID_COMMAND SHALL be returned if the accessing fabric index doesn’t match the CreatorFabricIndex in the credential record pointed to by the CredentialIndex field value of the Credential parameter.

On the other hand, "5.2.10.40. ClearCredential Command" does not perform such checks (intentionally).

