[2026-04-06T20:54:42Z] user_01132: ### Analysis
The cluster server in thermostat-server-suggestions.cpp handles AddThermostatSuggestion (lines 192–195):
```
MatterReportingAttributeChangeCallback(endpoint, Thermostat::Id, ThermostatSuggestions::Id);
// Re-evaluate the current thermostat suggestion.
TEMPORARY_RETURN_IGNORED delegate->ReEvaluateCurrentSuggestion();
```
Note that ThermostatSuggestions (the list) is properly dirty-marked, but CurrentThermostatSuggestion (the selected suggestion) is not reported here - that responsibility appears delegated to ReEvaluateCurrentSuggestion.

In the reference delegate (thermostat-delegate-impl.cpp), SetCurrentThermostatSuggestion (lines 299–312) does have a reporting call:
```
void ThermostatDelegate::SetCurrentThermostatSuggestion(size_t index)
{
    if (index <= GetMaxThermostatSuggestions())
    {
        bool hasChanged = (mIndexOfCurrentSuggestion != index);
        if (hasChanged)
        {
            mIndexOfCurrentSuggestion = index;
            MatterReportingAttributeChangeCallback(mEndpointId, Thermostat::Id,
                Attributes::CurrentThermostatSuggestion::Id);
        }
    }
}
```
However, ReEvaluateCurrentSuggestion (lines 437–439) assigns mIndexOfCurrentSuggestion before calling SetCurrentThermostatSuggestion:
```
mIndexOfCurrentSuggestion = GetThermostatSuggestionIndexWithEarliestEffectiveTime(currentMatterEpochTimestamp);
SetCurrentThermostatSuggestion(mIndexOfCurrentSuggestion);
```
Since mIndexOfCurrentSuggestion is already set to the new value on line 438, the hasChanged check on line 305 is always false, and MatterReportingAttributeChangeCallback is never called.

On initial startup, mIndexOfCurrentSuggestion is initialized to mMaxThermostatSuggestions (representing Null/no suggestion). When the first suggestion is added, it should change from mMaxThermostatSuggestions to 0, but the pre-assignment defeats the change detection.

### Suggested fix 
Remove the pre-assignment in ReEvaluateCurrentSuggestion:
// Before (broken):
```
mIndexOfCurrentSuggestion = GetThermostatSuggestionIndexWithEarliestEffectiveTime(currentMatterEpochTimestamp);
SetCurrentThermostatSuggestion(mIndexOfCurrentSuggestion);
```
// After (fixed):
```
SetCurrentThermostatSuggestion(
    GetThermostatSuggestionIndexWithEarliestEffectiveTime(currentMatterEpochTimestamp));
```


